==Reaction==
The tournament was quite well received, although some commentators have stated that, excluding São Paulo and Liverpool, the quality of football was quite poor leading to a view that it might have been better retaining the two continent format of the [[Intercontinental Cup (1960–2004)|European/South American Cup]].<ref>{{cite web |url=http://edition.cnn.com/2005/SPORT/football/12/18/soccer.japan/ |title=CNN.com – Sao Paulo lift World Clubs trophy – Dec 19, 2005 |publisher=CNN |date= |access-date=28 May 2022}}</ref>

